## What this file cannot tell you

Everything above is generated. This file is replaced wholesale by every
`cs update`, so nothing hand-written survives in it — the engine-profile
provenance, what was authored into `USER_NOTES`, the send boundary as it
actually stands, the mechanisms that exist because something once went wrong,
and the known gaps all live in
[`company/clone-notes.md`](../company/clone-notes.md), which the kernel creates
once and then never touches. Read it next; it is the half of this clone that
no template can derive.